<#c846e6>SOUL GAUGE / SOUL POWER</>
Soul Power (soul gauge full)		^X
  Every hit she lands (or that gets blocked) feeds the soul
  gauge (bottom of the screen). At full, X with no direction
  held is Soul Power: a short pose, then 8 seconds in which
  her specials (Soul Spark, Soul Spiral, Soul Reflect) and the
  Soul Spark / Reflect projectiles do 35% more damage, Soul
  Throw and Soul Drain hit harder and Soul Drain heals her.
  It empties the gauge. The gauge also resets every round.

<#c846e6>SYSTEM</>
Parry		^Z
  Catches any attack. A whiff costs 80 meter and leaves her
  open.
Soul Drain (grab)		^Y   (hold _B for the back version)
Soul Fade (air grab)		^Y   (in the air, near the enemy)
Burst (while being hit)		^A_+^B_+^C
  Invincible, no damage, hard knockdown. 75 second cooldown.
  Refills faster once a combo on her passes 15% of her life.
Zero Counter (while blocking, 1 bar)		_B_DB_D^A / ^B / ^C / ^X
Dash		_F_F
Back Step		_B_B
Jump		_U

<#c846e6>NORMALS</>
  Chain: A > B > C (standing, crouching and in the air), upward
  only, on hit or block. Any normal that connected also cancels
  into specials, EX moves and supers.
  A / B / C are her light / medium / heavy punches. X is her
  light kick and the kick button for Soul Spiral.
Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Light Kick		^X
Soul Piede		_F^X
Slide		_DF^X
Crouching Light / Medium / Heavy		_D^A / _D^B / _D^C
Crouching Light Kick		_D^X
Air Light / Medium / Heavy		^A / ^B / ^C
Air Light Kick		^X

<#c846e6>SPECIALS</>
  C is the EX version (500 meter). Without the meter, C is
  the heavy version. Soul Spiral uses X, and X_+^C for the EX.
Soul Spark		_B_DB_D_DF_F^A / ^B / ^C
Soul Spiral		_D_DF_F^X
Soul Reflect		_D_DB_B^A / ^B / ^C
Soul Throw		_F_D_DF^A / ^B / ^C

<#c846e6>EX MOVES (500 meter)</>
EX Soul Spark		_B_DB_D_DF_F^C
EX Soul Spiral		_D_DF_F^X_+^C
EX Soul Reflect		_D_DB_B^C
EX Soul Throw		_F_D_DF^C

<#c846e6>SUPERS</>
Aura Soul Throw (1 bar)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^A / ^B
Aura Soul Spark (1 bar)		_D_DB_B_D_DB_B^A / ^B
Illusion Spark (5 bars)		_D_DF_F_D_DF_F^C
